    "result_text": "Build passes (exit 0, no failures) and all tests are green \u2014 the 6 tests across `AcceptanceTest` and `BusinessDaysTest` pass. The audit log confirms the new format working end-to-end: `memberId=NSW2716E6609E1` (REGION=`NSW`, FY=`27` for a 2026-09-21 registration, HASH8=`16E6609E`, CHK=`1`), and the structured event now emits `\"memberId\":\"NSW2716E6609E1\"`.\n\n## What I changed\n\n**Unified identifier** \u2014 introduced `memberId` = `<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>` and removed the three old fields:\n- **`MemberId`** (new, replaces `CustomerCode`) \u2014 `format(region, registrationDate, telephone, lastName)` composes the region, 2-digit fiscal year (`FiscalYear`), the shared upper-hex 8-char SHA-256 (`Hashes.upperHexPrefix`), and a Luhn `CHK` over the digits of `<REGION><FY><HASH8>` (`Luhn.checkDigit`). Keeps `deduplicate(...)` for collision handling and `region(...)` (leading-letters extraction, since the FY segment always starts with a digit).\n- **`AssignMemberId`** (new, replaces `AssignCustomerCode`) \u2014 mints and de-duplicates the id against active owners' `memberId`. Now runs correctly after `rollRegistrationDate` so the FY segment sees the business-day-adjusted date.\n- **`Owner`** \u2014 field/column `customerCode`/`customer_code` \u2192 `memberId`/`member_id`; `getPrimaryIdentifier()` returns it.\n- **`OwnerMapper`** \u2014 dropped `checkDigit` and `membershipNumber` mappings/methods; added `memberId`; `locality` now reads the region from `memberId` (falling back to postcode/city for legacy rows).\n- **`AuditOwnerCreated`** / **`OwnerCreatedEvent`** \u2014 the audit line and structured event now carry `memberId`.\n- **Deleted** `CustomerCode`, `AssignCustomerCode`, `MembershipNumber`.\n\n**Config/schema** \u2014 `openapi.yml` replaces the three field schemas with one `memberId` (regenerates `OwnerDto`); the create pipeline YAML renames the step; all four `schema.sql` dialects rename the column (`member_id`, widened to hold the longer id); `FiscalYear` javadoc updated.\n\nEach piece stayed in its existing home \u2014 formatting in `MemberId`, the pipeline step in `AssignMemberId`, Luhn/fiscal-year logic reused from `Luhn`/`FiscalYear` rather than duplicated.",
